# .understandignore - patterns for files/dirs to exclude from analysis
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs)
# Built-in defaults are always excluded unless negated:
#   node_modules/, .git/, dist/, build/, obj/, *.lock, *.min.js, etc.
#
# Recommended for this repository: keep the graph focused on the Vanmo app
# rather than local agent/plugin configuration and generated design skills.
.agents/
.codex/
.cursor/
.derivedData/
DerivedData/
Pods/
Packages/
build/
doc/
issues/
plan/
prompt/
Vanmo/Frameworks/FFmpeg/

